{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロングヘアーを楽しみに全握と個握来てくださった方..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握は午前のライブに備えて後ろで髪の毛まとめてたのでロング感が分からず\n明日の個握は楽しみにしてるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っと言っていただいたのですが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしても私は少し短くしたくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホテルに夜帰った時にフロントに電話して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田\n「すみません。はさみって貸出することできますかね？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フロント\n「部屋に持ち込むことは出来ないんですけどフロントでお貸しすることはできます！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言われ、フロントで髪の毛を切るのはダメかなと思って"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「じゃぁ大丈夫です！すみません有難う御座いました」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってやめたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもやっぱり切りたくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイクさんに頼むのも私ごとすぎるしな...って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握の前に思い切って\n文房具屋さんのハサミでいけるでしょ！っと思って切ってみたら\n思ったより短く切っちゃって"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり初心者には無理だったようで。。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左右非対称のガッタガタになってしまって"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなに大爆笑されて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイクさんには"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「はははっ！そんなんじゃ出されないよー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っと言われ結局メイクさんに髪を揃えてもらってきれいにしてもらいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これが自分で切った毛..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガタガタの写真は焦りすぎて撮れなかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短いのに合わせるとこんななっちった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仕上がりはこんなに軽くすいてもらっていい感じになりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会の会場の裏側ではこんなことが起こってました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう一生自分の髪の毛は切りません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深く反省しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんご迷惑お掛けしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋個別の後におばーちゃんおじーちゃん\nと兄、母、父、で大阪に旅行に行きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んなところを観光して歩き回って疲れたので全員で足ツボに行ってリフレッシュしたり\nたこ焼きを食べたりとGW過ぎたけど満喫しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ずっといい天気すぎる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/10/8059289/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"}],"source":"archive"}